<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 17.02 to 5771.94.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 1.73 to 359.73.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.19.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1464 to 860.</p>
<p>Volume was 398,834,720, compared with 375,199,270 Wednesday.</p>
